# Terraform working directories and state (never commit state - it can contain secrets)
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (pins provider versions/checksums)

# The course-level .gitignore ignores terraform.tfvars. The assignment requires it,
# and this one holds no secrets (LocalStack dummy creds live in provider.tf), so re-include it.
!terraform.tfvars
